    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seas of Raesenia is a naval fantasy game where you restore an ancient high-tech battleship to sail the world. Along the way, you will raise a ragtag crew, fend off hostile factions seeking to take your ship, and unravel the mystery behind the magical dome separating you from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/50a7056a1b41dc63e2279440d48ecab7.poster.webp?t=1751053818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/50a7056a1b41dc63e2279440d48ecab7.webp?t=1751053818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise a crew to restore your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore a mysterious ancient battleship to its former glory. Discover lost blueprints, reclaim ancient technology, and build your ship to fight in any way you like. Build outposts to gather more resources, which will enable the creation of the necessary weapons, equipment, and rooms for restoration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ unique weapons to fight your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases on islands and transform old ruins into structures that provide valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Techmine for lost blueprints and use them to enhance your ship's strength.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a massive world with four planned regions, each with multiple islands and towns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/45bf0ae2405b2bbe910f15a98f8e30ae.poster.webp?t=1751053818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/45bf0ae2405b2bbe910f15a98f8e30ae.webp?t=1751053818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multihour story-based campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 main storyline quests and equally as many side quests are planned. The world is encased in a magical dome known as the Veil, and no one has ever managed to pierce it. However, Percy\u2019s parents managed to go through it years ago and were never seen again.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve your dreams of becoming the next legendary sailor to pierce the veil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit crew from around the world. Solve their problems, and they will join you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a rich fantasy story where your high-tech adventures clash with a magical industry setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of the Veil, a magical dome separating the kingdom of Raesenia from the outside world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/a10c9f6dc9016660b4934b0d0b628c23.poster.webp?t=1751053818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/a10c9f6dc9016660b4934b0d0b628c23.webp?t=1751053818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seas of Raesenia is a naval fantasy game where you restore an ancient high-tech battleship to sail the world. Along the way, you will raise a ragtag crew, fend off hostile factions seeking to take your ship, and unravel the mystery behind the magical dome separating you from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/50a7056a1b41dc63e2279440d48ecab7.poster.webp?t=1751053818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/50a7056a1b41dc63e2279440d48ecab7.webp?t=1751053818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise a crew to restore your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore a mysterious ancient battleship to its former glory. Discover lost blueprints, reclaim ancient technology, and build your ship to fight in any way you like. Build outposts to gather more resources, which will enable the creation of the necessary weapons, equipment, and rooms for restoration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ unique weapons to fight your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases on islands and transform old ruins into structures that provide valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Techmine for lost blueprints and use them to enhance your ship's strength.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a massive world with four planned regions, each with multiple islands and towns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/45bf0ae2405b2bbe910f15a98f8e30ae.poster.webp?t=1751053818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/45bf0ae2405b2bbe910f15a98f8e30ae.webp?t=1751053818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multihour story-based campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 main storyline quests and equally as many side quests are planned. The world is encased in a magical dome known as the Veil, and no one has ever managed to pierce it. However, Percy\u2019s parents managed to go through it years ago and were never seen again.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve your dreams of becoming the next legendary sailor to pierce the veil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit crew from around the world. Solve their problems, and they will join you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a rich fantasy story where your high-tech adventures clash with a magical industry setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of the Veil, a magical dome separating the kingdom of Raesenia from the outside world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/a10c9f6dc9016660b4934b0d0b628c23.poster.webp?t=1751053818\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/a10c9f6dc9016660b4934b0d0b628c23.webp?t=1751053818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
